# Visual test baseline images (these will be stored outside
# the repo in the future, but we don't haven't decided exactly
# where yet, so for now they get generated into a gitignored dir.)
#
# OMEGA-DELTA-0034/0035: Omega's own baselines are committed. Upstream leaves
# these uncommitted pending a decision on where to keep them, which is why
# `zed_visual_test_runner` shipped with no baselines and no invocation and
# every Omega packet that needed rendered evidence had none. A baseline nobody
# committed cannot fail, and three lanes in a row reported "no check here looks
# at a rendered pixel". Only the `omega_*` captures are re-included; the
# inherited suite keeps upstream's arrangement.
/crates/zed/test_fixtures/visual_tests/*
!/crates/zed/test_fixtures/visual_tests/omega_*.png

